  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the application is not communicating clearly why it has failed when it fails due to OS and disk issues such us a lack of inode availability or disk space.   The behavior we were seeing was that it got hung while generating the html report.  The task here is to ensure that the validator fails quickly and clearly when there is an underlying issue while generating the report.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
